	(text "U3: SYNC left open with RT fitted sets the frequency from RT.\nL2: XGL4020 shares the 4 x 4 mm body of the XAL4020 whose land pattern is used; confirm against the XGL4020 drawing.\nC20 47nF: Bootstrap capacitor. Data sheet range 0.022 to 0.1 uF\nC21 100nF: VBIAS decoupling. Data sheet range 0.1 to 1 uF\nC22 22nF: Slow start. t = C * 0.7 V / 5 uA = 3.1 ms\nR20 46.4k: Frequency set, 1 MHz. f(MHz) = 51k / (R + 4.7k) gives 46.3k"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
